# Reference PDFs — large, and not all are under redistribution-permissive licenses.
# See AGENTS.md "Git & GitHub conventions" for how to reconstitute the library.
*.pdf

# Cloned reference repos — keep only each repo's README.md as a pointer;
# the actual code is other people's, easily re-cloned from the URLs in
# PAPERS_SUMMARY.md "Code repositories". If a full clone ever lands back
# in repos/<name>/, only its README.md gets committed.
repos/*/*
!repos/*/README.md

# Original scoping conversation — kept local-only (references business context
# in the abstract; not for the public repo).
research.md

# macOS
.DS_Store
